@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+# 9. Bulk ticket imports
+
+Date: 2026-11-15
+Status: Accepted
+
+## Context
+
+Moving from the old tracker requires up to 5000 tickets per request, with all-or-none validation and ordinary creation effects.
+
+## Decision
+
+We validate every item in input order before calling the store. The store shares single-ticket creation effects and
+saves the entire batch once. Errors identify the first invalid array index. The import endpoint allows 10 MiB of
+JSON so full batches, including escaped title and requester strings, fit without changing ordinary request limits.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Invalid batches leave ticket ids, audit entries and the outbox unchanged. Successful batches retain input order and
+the existing persistence format. Saving once avoids repeatedly serializing the growing state for each imported ticket.
